exteriorMultiplication -- "multiplication maps in the exterior algebra"
***********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        mu = exteriorMultiplication n
  * Inputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, positive integer
  * Outputs:
      * mu, a *note hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,, $mu\{p,q\}\wedge^p
        k^n\otimes \wedge^q k^n \to \wedge^{p+q}k^n$

Description
===========

The basis of each $\wedge^p k^n$ is given in lex order.

Caveat
======

This is not the order of the basis in the output of koszulComplex ff; rather,
use trueKoszul ff.

See also
========

  * *note trueKoszul: trueKoszul, -- "Makes Koszul complex, with bases sorted
    in lex"

